    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, why look at the packaging process? The carrier logs specifically say the handling was fine. If we're just going to end up giving them a full refund anyway to keep the CSAT high, isn't it more efficient to just deny it now since the data doesn't support their claim? I don't want us losing money on customers who might be lying.",
