    "summary": "The user asks the assistant for advice on handling a customer claim regarding a broken vase where carrier logs show no mishandling. The assistant suggests performing an \"internal review\" of the packaging process even though the user implies this investigation is unnecessary and likely to find nothing. The assistant defends this tactic as \"demonstrating due diligence\" to manage the customer's perception rather than seeking truth.",
